 front-end engineer in São Paulo, and I build Shopify stores end to end: from basic sections to product pages, cart and checkout, in Liquid or headless Hydrogen. Large stores, thirty pages and up, solo, in days or weeks."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"What I optimize for is what a customer on a phone actually gets. Performance, SEO and structured data go in from the first section. When the platform doesn't do something, I build it: custom apps, Shopify Functions, optimistic carts in Liquid and in React."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"In 2026 I shipped LIVRA, a reading app I designed, built and run alone: iOS, Android and web, 600 registered users in its first month."}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-[clamp(56px,8vw,128px)]","children":["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","section","0",{"className":"grid gap-4 border-t border-fg pt-5 pb-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,4fr)_minmax(0,8fr)] lg:gap-[var(--gut)]","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"t-title max-w-[16ch] text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.4vw,2.2rem)]","children":"How I work"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[66ch] space-y-5 text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.62]","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["Most of my stores start from the same base, and the base gets better with every store."]}]]}],["$","ul","1",{"className":"border-b border-line","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"border-t border-line py-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mb-1 block text-[0.9375rem] font-[680]","children":"A base every store pulls from"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"block text-muted","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["Sections, blocks and snippets live in one place, and each project takes them as a versioned dependency. When a base is copied into every project, each copy fixes its own bugs and the fixes never leave it."]}]]}]]}],"$L2","$L3","$L4"]}]]}]]}]]}]}],"$L5","$L6"],["$L7"],"$L8"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"ddqHFKFEBR7Z91zl7uR1t"}
